   "text": "Why this award\nCheapest valid price on each line among vendors that passed the\nquestionnaire. Combining both plants' volumes moves V2 into its\nhigher tier on 6 lines.\n\n(The AI writes these sentences; every figure comes from the\ncalculation.)",
